The filesystem Skill catalog guidance in src/main/skillsStore.ts is copied from
codex-rs/ext/skills/src/catalog_prompt.rs in https://github.com/openai/codex.
Anas renders its own available Skill sources and projects selected instructions
using the Codex <skill> message format.

src/main/codexPatch.ts is a TypeScript port of parser.rs,
streaming_parser.rs (batch processing), seek_sequence.rs, file_update.rs
(compute_replacements), and text_file.rs from codex-rs/apply-patch/src/.
src/main/codexPatchSpec.json copies the freeform description and Lark grammar
from codex-rs/core/src/tools/handlers/apply_patch_spec.rs and
codex-rs/core/assets/tools/apply_patch.lark verbatim.
src/main/test-fixtures/codex-patch.json contains upstream scenario inputs
and outputs generated by the original Rust parser and text-editing code.
Pinned source: https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/a6839a481223fb5faab539a9eb2b7174ae29e560

Anas adapts the batch API to TypeScript, LangChain provider transports, and
its own transactional filesystem and recovery layer. The original Rust
sources are used only by the development reference verification script.
